sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title KYC, Bank Details & Agreement Signing Workflow

    participant C as Customer
    participant FE as Frontend (Dashboard)
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Admin as Admin Dashboard

    %% ============================================
    %% PREREQUISITE: Loan Must Be APPROVED
    %% ============================================
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note over C,DB: PREREQUISITE: Loan Status = APPROVED
        C->>FE: Navigate to "My Loans"
        FE->>BE: GET /loan-applications/me
        BE->>DB: Fetch User's Applications
        DB-->>BE: Applications List
        BE-->>FE: Show Applications
        FE-->>C: Display APPROVED Loan<br/>with "Complete KYC" button
    end

    %% ============================================
    %% STEP 1: KYC DOCUMENT UPLOAD
    %% ============================================
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over C,DB: STEP 1: KYC Document Upload
        
        C->>FE: Click "Complete KYC"
        FE->>BE: GET /kyc/status/{application_id}
        BE->>DB: Check KYC Eligibility<br/>(Loan must be APPROVED)
        DB-->>BE: Eligibility Status
        BE-->>FE: KYC Status Response:<br/>• step_1_documents: pending<br/>• step_2_bank_details: locked<br/>• step_3_agreement: locked
        FE-->>C: Show KYC Workflow<br/>(3 Steps with Step 1 Active)
        
        Note over C: Required Documents:<br/>1. ID Proof (PAN/Aadhaar/Passport)<br/>2. Address Proof (Utility Bill/Aadhaar)
        
        C->>FE: Upload ID Proof (PAN Card)
        FE->>BE: POST /kyc/documents/{app_id}<br/>document_type: ID_PROOF<br/>category: PAN
        BE->>DB: Save Document Record<br/>status: PENDING_VERIFICATION
        DB-->>BE: Document Saved
        BE-->>FE: Upload Success
        FE-->>C: ✅ ID Proof Uploaded
        
        C->>FE: Upload Address Proof
        FE->>BE: POST /kyc/documents/{app_id}<br/>document_type: ADDRESS_PROOF<br/>category: UTILITY_BILL
        BE->>DB: Save Document Record
        DB-->>BE: Document Saved
        BE-->>FE: Upload Success
        FE-->>C: ✅ Address Proof Uploaded
        
        Note over Admin: Admin Verifies Documents
        Admin->>BE: GET /admin/documents
        BE->>DB: Fetch Pending Documents
        DB-->>BE: Documents List
        BE-->>Admin: Display for Review
        
        Admin->>BE: POST /admin/documents/{id}/verify<br/>is_valid: true
        BE->>DB: Update status: VERIFIED
        DB-->>BE: Verification Complete
        BE-->>Admin: Document Verified
        
        Note over C: Both Documents Verified<br/>Step 2 Unlocked
    end

    %% ============================================
    %% STEP 2: BANK DETAILS SUBMISSION
    %% ============================================
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over C,DB: STEP 2: Bank Account Details
        
        C->>FE: Click Step 2: Bank Details
        FE->>BE: GET /kyc/status/{application_id}
        BE-->>FE: step_2_bank_details: active
        FE-->>C: Show Bank Details Form
        
        C->>FE: Enter Bank Details:<br/>• Account Holder Name<br/>• Bank Name<br/>• Account Number<br/>• IFSC Code
        
        FE->>BE: POST /kyc/bank-details/{app_id}
        
        Note over BE: Validate IFSC Format<br/>Encrypt Account Number<br/>Store Masked: ****1234
        
        BE->>DB: Save Bank Details<br/>(Encrypted)
        DB-->>BE: Bank Details Saved
        BE-->>FE: Bank Details Submitted
        FE-->>C: ✅ Bank Details Saved<br/>Step 3 Unlocked
        
        Note over C: Can view Admin Bank<br/>for EMI payments
        C->>FE: View Admin Bank Details
        FE->>BE: GET /admin-bank-details
        BE->>DB: Fetch Admin Bank
        DB-->>BE: Bank Info
        BE-->>FE: Admin Bank Details
        FE-->>C: Display Bank for Payments
    end

    %% ============================================
    %% STEP 3: LOAN AGREEMENT SIGNING
    %% ============================================
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over C,DB: STEP 3: Loan Agreement Signing
        
        C->>FE: Click Step 3: Agreement
        FE->>BE: GET /kyc/agreement/{app_id}
        
        Note over BE: Generate Agreement:<br/>• Principal Amount<br/>• Interest Rate<br/>• Tenure<br/>• EMI Amount<br/>• Processing Fee<br/>• Total Repayable<br/>• Terms & Conditions
        
        BE->>DB: Create/Get Agreement Record
        DB-->>BE: Agreement Data
        BE-->>FE: Loan Agreement Details
        FE-->>C: Display Agreement<br/>with Download Option
        
        C->>FE: Download Agreement PDF
        FE->>BE: GET /kyc/agreement/{app_id}/download
        BE-->>FE: PDF (RBI Compliant Format)
        FE-->>C: Download PDF
        
        C->>FE: Check Consent Checkbox<br/>"I agree to terms"
        C->>FE: Click "Sign Agreement"
        
        FE->>BE: POST /kyc/agreement/{app_id}/sign<br/>consent: true
        BE->>DB: Update Agreement:<br/>consent_given: true<br/>signed_at: timestamp<br/>status: SIGNED
        DB-->>BE: Agreement Signed
        BE-->>FE: Signing Confirmed
        FE-->>C: ✅ Agreement Signed
    end

    %% ============================================
    %% STEP 4: COMPLETE KYC
    %% ============================================
    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over C,DB: STEP 4: Complete KYC Process
        
        C->>FE: All Steps Complete<br/>Click "Complete KYC"
        FE->>BE: POST /kyc/complete/{app_id}
        
        Note over BE: Validate All Steps:<br/>✅ Documents Verified<br/>✅ Bank Details Saved<br/>✅ Agreement Signed
        
        BE->>DB: Update KYC Tracking:<br/>status: COMPLETED<br/>ready_for_disbursement: true
        DB-->>BE: KYC Complete
        
        BE->>DB: Update Application:<br/>status: KYC_COMPLETED
        DB-->>BE: Status Updated
        
        BE-->>FE: KYC Completed Successfully
        FE-->>C: 🎉 KYC Complete!<br/>Awaiting Disbursement
        
        Note over Admin: Application Ready for<br/>Loan Disbursement
    end
